        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >”Reach to Tsukuyomi&quot; is an exhilarating 2D platform action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player-controlled protagonist, Kaede, adventures through stages infested with ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exhilarating Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's basic actions consist of simple attacks, jumps, and dashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, there are counters that can be triggered by hitting a well-timed dash in time with an enemy's attack, and long-range attacks with shurikens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/82372dad4e8508734da90fe734b5c57e.poster.avif?t=1766708813\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/82372dad4e8508734da90fe734b5c57e.webm?t=1766708813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/82372dad4e8508734da90fe734b5c57e.mp4?t=1766708813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Numerous Enemies and Bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various kinds of enemies appear in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each has its own unique attack method and characteristics, so it is necessary to adapt your strategy accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/af785c69584bfc168f42b65579a60059.poster.avif?t=1766708813\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/af785c69584bfc168f42b65579a60059.webm?t=1766708813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/af785c69584bfc168f42b65579a60059.mp4?t=1766708813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters and Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the main character Kaede decides to return to her hometown, but what awaits her is a hometown occupied by Yokai (Japanese monsters).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to free her hometown from the yokai, Kaede ventures out on her own, only to be confronted by her childhood friends Sakura and Murasaki, who she grew up with. ......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/10a227693c8b72ecd141f60002b02e22.poster.avif?t=1766708813\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/10a227693c8b72ecd141f60002b02e22.webm?t=1766708813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/10a227693c8b72ecd141f60002b02e22.mp4?t=1766708813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >”Reach to Tsukuyomi&quot; is an exhilarating 2D platform action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player-controlled protagonist, Kaede, adventures through stages infested with ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exhilarating Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's basic actions consist of simple attacks, jumps, and dashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, there are counters that can be triggered by hitting a well-timed dash in time with an enemy's attack, and long-range attacks with shurikens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/82372dad4e8508734da90fe734b5c57e.poster.avif?t=1766708813\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/82372dad4e8508734da90fe734b5c57e.webm?t=1766708813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/82372dad4e8508734da90fe734b5c57e.mp4?t=1766708813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Numerous Enemies and Bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various kinds of enemies appear in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each has its own unique attack method and characteristics, so it is necessary to adapt your strategy accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/af785c69584bfc168f42b65579a60059.poster.avif?t=1766708813\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/af785c69584bfc168f42b65579a60059.webm?t=1766708813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/af785c69584bfc168f42b65579a60059.mp4?t=1766708813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters and Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the main character Kaede decides to return to her hometown, but what awaits her is a hometown occupied by Yokai (Japanese monsters).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to free her hometown from the yokai, Kaede ventures out on her own, only to be confronted by her childhood friends Sakura and Murasaki, who she grew up with. ......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/10a227693c8b72ecd141f60002b02e22.poster.avif?t=1766708813\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/10a227693c8b72ecd141f60002b02e22.webm?t=1766708813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2606330/extras/10a227693c8b72ecd141f60002b02e22.mp4?t=1766708813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
